[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Kontrol-ID is installed as a standalone secure web gateway derived from the
E2Guardian engine.

Configuration: %%PREFIX%%/etc/e2guardian
Service:       service kontrol_id start
RC setting:    kontrol_id_enable="YES"

The initial port preserves the proven E2Guardian configuration layout to allow
controlled migration of existing policy groups and lists.  Kontrol-ID conflicts
with the conventional E2Guardian engine and GUI packages; do not force both
engines to coexist.

The service remains disabled after installation until its managed configuration
has been generated and validated by the Kontrol-ID package.
EOM
}
]
